      "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 24 2026 13:23:41 GMT+0000",
      "alt": "kino 420",
      "text": "<ul>\r\n<li>Enhanced Performance</li>\r\n<li>Performance boosts up to 80% better than previous generation on i5 processor. The 10th Gen Intel® Core platform supports up to 10 cores and improved performance over Coffee Lake-Refresh. With increased I/O capacity and the latest DDR4-2933 memory support, these processors deliver the performance required to consolidate industrial multiple workloads.</li>\r\n<li>Let's take a closer look at the KINO-DH420</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Oct 02 2026 13:47:48 GMT+0000",
