      "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 24 2026 13:23:41 GMT+0000",
      "alt": "kino 420",
      "text": "<p>The on-board triple 2.5GbE controllers enable the KINO-DH420 Mini-ITX SBC to meet the bandwidth-intensive requirements such as large file transfers and high-resolution video streaming.</p>\r\n",
