      "imageRatio": "30",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 24 2026 13:23:41 GMT+0000",
      "alt": "kino 420",
      "text": "<h2>Delivers HDMI+DP 4K Resolution for Real-time Monitoring</h2>\r\n<p>Running with Intel® UHD Graphics of 11th Gen processor at 800 MHz allows the system to display videos and images in stunning 4K resolution via HDMI 1.4b and DP 1.4 dual independent display. The enhanced visual quality responses the demand of high precision display.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIEI's tBIOS allows users to navigate with finger on a touch-enabled monitor to make BIOS configuration easily.</p>\r\n",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 24 2026 13:45:05 GMT+0000",
