      "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><th>KINO-DH420-R10</th>\n<td width=\"80%\">Mini-ITX SBC supports LGA1200 Intel® 10th Generation Core™ i9/i7/i5/i3, Celeron® and Pentium® processor, DDR4, dual independent displays, triple 2.5GbE LAN, M.2, SATA 6Gb/s, HD Audio and RoHS</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
